<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 3,569 packages of landed tea sold at this weeks London sale was 111.28 pence a kilo against 110.89 last week and 118.94 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 28,087 pkgs sold so far this year is 114.07 pence against 114.90 pence for the 31,621 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
